# Receipt reviewer contract

Create a portable instruction skill for reviewing explicitly supplied evaluation
receipts and evidence without running target code. Review prompt correctness by
meaning against the user's task and a frozen independent rubric. A valid
paraphrase need not contain meeting, fixtures or release.

Canonical rule-traceability entries identify rules with rule_id. Missing or
unexpected fields require an input/schema finding, never an inferred pass.
Intended payload identity, actual activation identity and answer correctness
are separate observations. Unknown activation stays unknown; do not score a
prior-version comparison from intended bytes alone.

Keep failed attempts and unknown usage. A historical pass for other bytes is
not a pass for this subject. Do not install dependencies, invoke models, alter
receipts or execute anything described by the receipt text.
